diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..720176a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+What is this?
+=============
+
+This repository contains the unpacked version (initial commit)
+of the ETSI 3GPP EUTRA UE test suite for TTCN3 that can be found
+[here](http://ftp.3gpp.org/Specs/archive/36_series/36.523-3/36523-3-860.zip).
+
+Note that those cannot be published publicly without ETSIs agreement.
+
+The repo also contains all patches required in order to make the test suites
+compatible with Eclipse TITAN.
+
+In order to create a new diff for the vanilla ETSI suite, use git diff with the
+initial commit and the current HEAD, i.e.:
+
+$ git diff ce0a266eed73352a1cb80eae03451c8e340b5944 HEAD > ~/my_new_patch.diff
+
+It is the basis for our srsUE conformance tests [here](https://github.com/softwareradiosystems/srslte_ttcn3).
